#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:2503
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:2503
msgid "Close Button"
msgstr "Przycisk Zamknij"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:2519
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:2519
